<title>USA: Saf T Lok sued by ex-CEO, claiming libel.</title>
<headline>Saf T Lok sued by ex-CEO, claiming libel.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saf T Lok Inc said on Monday that its former chief executive, Lisa Broderick, filed suit against the company and its chairman, Frank Brooks, alleging libel and slander.</p>
<p>Broderick's suit, filed in Palm Beach,  Fla., accuses Brooks and the company of defaming her after she resigned November 19 by claiming she was asked to leave. Broderick said it was her decision.</p>
<p>Broderick currently is a managing director of American Capital Partners Ltd in New York.</p>
<p>Brooks was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
